     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Pass every endurance test: With a base body made of a light metal alloy specially developed for measuring devices and equipped with high-quality branded components, \"smile\" devices are extremely robust and durable. Whether for large-scale production or medium-sized companies - the different sizes, electronics and equipment variants make \"smile\" ideal for day-to-day use in any production facility, even right next to the CNC machine.</p>",
