  {
   "type": "hotspots",
   "header": "",
   "intro": "",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/5/csm_smileCompact_hotspots_414afaf178.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1238,
    "h": 709
   },
   "spots": [
    {
     "x": 42.935,
     "y": 34.82,
     "label": "One-hand operating handle",
     "text": "<h3>One-hand operating handle</h3> <h4>One-hand operating handle</h4> <p>For quick and safe adjustment of the measuring carriage in both axes at the touch of a button.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 51.685,
     "y": 45.066,
     "label": "Image Processing | Optics",
     "text": "<h3>Image Processing | Optics</h3> <h4>Image processing | Optics</h4> <p>Reliable precision guaranteed - with telecentric lens and CCD camera including integrated 360° LED incident light for cutting edge inspection.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 51.141,
     "y": 60.057,
     "label": "High-precision spindle SK50",
     "text": "<h3>High-precision spindle SK50</h3> <h4>High-precision spindle SK50</h4> <p>Impresses with integrated calibration spheres and a concentricity of 0.002 mm. Separate zero gauges are superfluous.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 76.522,
     "y": 35.958,
     "label": "User interface",
     "text": "<h3>User interface</h3> <h4>User interface</h4> <p>ZOLLER measuring device control (Panel PC) with 13\" touch display.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 79.783,
     "y": 58.065,
     "label": "Table electronics",
     "text": "<h3>Table electronics</h3> <h4>Table electronics</h4> <p>Desk electronics with variable monitor position and space for label printer and key rack.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 66.467,
     "y": 75.712,
     "label": "Label printer",
     "text": "<h3>Label printer</h3> <h4>Label printer</h4> <p>The label printer outputs the necessary tool parameters, such as ID and adapter numbers, Z, X, radius dimensions and angles as plain text or codes.</p>"
    },
    {
     "x": 49.62,
     "y": 69.165,
     "label": "Membrane keypad",
     "text": "<h3>Membrane keypad</h3> <h4>Membrane keypad</h4> <p>The membrane keypad controls all power-operated spindle functions such as spindle brake, 4 x 90° locking and optionally available vacuum clamping.</p>"
    }
   ],
