  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Change the efficiency of your manufacturing </h2>",
   "body": "<p>»smile« will reduce costs in your production and enable your machines and tools to spend more time in production. It is a precise investment that quickly pays for itself.</p> <p><strong>Take advantage of our online starter package »smile 420 / pilot 4.0« now.</strong><br/><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/shop/smile420-pilot40-en\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy now</a></p>",
